#. Content of the 'about' (HTML) field in DocType 'Product Bundle'
#: erpnext/selling/doctype/product_bundle/product_bundle.json:66
msgid "<h3>About Product Bundle</h3>\n\n"
"<p>Aggregate group of <b>Items</b> into another <b>Item</b>. This is useful if you are bundling a certain <b>Items</b> into a package and you maintain stock of the packed <b>Items</b> and not the aggregate <b>Item</b>.</p>\n"
"<p>The package <b>Item</b> will have <code>Is Stock Item</code> as <b>No</b> and <code>Is Sales Item</code> as <b>Yes</b>.</p>\n"
"<h4>Example:</h4>\n"
"<p>If you are selling Laptops and Backpacks separately and have a special price if the customer buys both, then the Laptop + Backpack will be a new Product Bundle Item.</p>"
msgstr "<h3>제품 번들 정보</h3>\\n\\n<p>여러 <b>품목</b>을 하나의 다른 <b>품목</b>으로 묶습니다. 특정 <b>품목</b>들을 하나의 패키지로 묶고, 집계된 <b>품목</b>이 아닌 포장된 <b>품목</b>의 재고를 관리하는 경우에 유용합니다.</p>\\n<p>패키지 <b>품목</b>은 <code>재고 품목 여부</code>가 <b>아니요</b>이고 <code>판매 품목 여부</code>가 <b>예</b>로 설정됩니다.</p>\\n<h4>예시:</h4>\\n<p>노트북과 백팩을 개별적으로 판매하면서 고객이 둘 다 구매하면 특별 가격을 적용하는 경우, 노트북 + 백팩은 새로운 제품 번들 품목이 됩니다.</p>"

#. Content of the 'Help' (HTML) field in DocType 'Currency Exchange Settings'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/currency_exchange_settings/currency_exchange_settings.json:51
#, python-brace-format
msgid "<h3>Currency Exchange Settings Help</h3>\n"
"<p>There are 3 variables that could be used within the endpoint, result key and in values of the parameter.</p>\n"
"<p>Exchange rate between {from_currency} and {to_currency} on {transaction_date} is fetched by the API.</p>\n"
"<p>Example: If your endpoint is exchange.com/2021-08-01, then, you will have to input exchange.com/{transaction_date}</p>"
msgstr "<h3>환전 설정 도움말</h3>\\n<p>엔드포인트, 결과 키 및 매개변수의 값에서 사용할 수 있는 변수가 3개 있습니다.</p>\\n<p>{from_currency}와 {to_currency} 간의 {transaction_date} 환율은 API를 통해 가져옵니다.</p>\\n<p>예: 엔드포인트가 exchange.com/2021-08-01인 경우 exchange.com/{transaction_date}를 입력해야 합니다.</p>"

#. Content of the 'Body and Closing Text Help' (HTML) field in DocType 'Dunning
#. Letter Text'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/dunning_letter_text/dunning_letter_text.json:56
#, python-brace-format, python-format
msgid "<h4>Body Text and Closing Text Example</h4>\n\n"
"<div>We have noticed that the following payments, totaling {{ currency }} {{ total_outstanding }}, are overdue:</div>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"{% for row in overdue_payments %}\n"
"<li>Invoice {{ row.sales_invoice }}: {{ currency }} {{ row.outstanding }}, due on {{ row.due_date }}.</li>\n"
"{% endfor %}\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<div>Please pay the amount due immediately to avoid any further dunning cost.</div>\n\n"
"<h4>How to get fieldnames</h4>\n\n"
"<p>The fieldnames you can use in your template are the fields in the document. You can find out the fields of any documents via Setup &gt; Customize Form View and selecting Dunning or Overdue Payment for the payment rows</p>\n\n"
"<h4>Templating</h4>\n\n"
"<p>Templates are compiled using the Jinja Templating Language. To learn more about Jinja, <a class=\"strong\" href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/dev/templates/\">read this documentation.</a></p>"
msgstr ""

#. Content of the 'Contract Template Help' (HTML) field in DocType 'Contract
#. Template'
#: erpnext/crm/doctype/contract_template/contract_template.json:55
msgid "<h4>Contract Template Example</h4>\n\n"
"<pre>Contract for Customer {{ party_name }}\n\n"
"-Valid From : {{ start_date }} \n"
"-Valid To : {{ end_date }}\n"
"</pre>\n\n"
"<h4>How to get fieldnames</h4>\n\n"
"<p>The field names you can use in your Contract Template are the fields in the Contract for which you are creating the template. You can find out the fields of any documents via Setup &gt; Customize Form View and selecting the document type (e.g. Contract)</p>\n\n"
"<h4>Templating</h4>\n\n"
"<p>Templates are compiled using the Jinja Templating Language. To learn more about Jinja, <a class=\"strong\" href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/dev/templates/\">read this documentation.</a></p>"
msgstr "<h4>계약서 양식 예시</h4>\n\n"
"<pre>고객 {{ party_name }} 계약서\n\n"
"-유효 시작일 : {{ start_date }} \n"
"-유효 종료일 : {{ end_date }}\n"
"</pre>\n\n"
"<h4>필드 이름 가져오는 방법</h4>\n\n"
"<p>계약서 양식에서 사용할 수 있는 필드 이름은 해당 양식을 만드는 계약의 필드입니다. 설정 &gt; 양식 사용자 정의 보기에서 문서 유형(예: 계약)을 선택하면 모든 문서의 필드를 확인할 수 있습니다.</p>\n\n"
"<h4>템플릿</h4>\n\n"
"<p>템플릿은 Jinja 템플릿 언어를 사용하여 컴파일됩니다. Jinja에 대해 더 알아보려면 <a class=\"strong\" href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/dev/templates/\">이 문서를 읽어보십시오.</a></p>"

#. Content of the 'Terms and Conditions Help' (HTML) field in DocType 'Terms
#. and Conditions'
#: erpnext/setup/doctype/terms_and_conditions/terms_and_conditions.json:54
msgid "<h4>Standard Terms and Conditions Example</h4>\n\n"
"<pre>Delivery Terms for Order number {{ name }}\n\n"
"-Order Date : {{ transaction_date }} \n"
"-Expected Delivery Date : {{ delivery_date }}\n"
"</pre>\n\n"
"<h4>How to get fieldnames</h4>\n\n"
"<p>The fieldnames you can use in your email template are the fields in the document from which you are sending the email. You can find out the fields of any documents via Setup &gt; Customize Form View and selecting the document type (e.g. Sales Invoice)</p>\n\n"
"<h4>Templating</h4>\n\n"
"<p>Templates are compiled using the Jinja Templating Language. To learn more about Jinja, <a class=\"strong\" href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/dev/templates/\">read this documentation.</a></p>"
msgstr "<h4>표준 약관 예시</h4>\n\n"
"<pre>주문 번호 {{ name }}의 배송 조건\n\n"
"-주문일 : {{ transaction_date }} \n"
"-예상 배송일 : {{ delivery_date }}\n"
"</pre>\n\n"
"<h4>필드 이름 확인 방법</h4>\n\n"
"<p>이메일 템플릿에서 사용할 수 있는 필드 이름은 이메일을 보내는 문서의 필드입니다. 설정 &gt; 양식 사용자 정의에서 문서 유형(예: 판매 송장)을 선택하면 모든 문서의 필드를 확인할 수 있습니다</p>\n\n"
"<h4>템플릿</h4>\n\n"
"<p>템플릿은 Jinja 템플릿 언어를 사용하여 컴파일됩니다. Jinja에 대해 더 알아보려면 <a class=\"strong\" href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/dev/templates/\">이 문서를 읽어보세요.</a></p>"

#. Content of the 'html_5' (HTML) field in DocType 'Bank Statement Import'
